      "speaker": "赤枭·赛伊德",
      "tag": "skill_lmg",
      "file": "saeed_05.ogg",
      "text": "M249 火力压制！看你往哪儿躲！",
      "bytes": 24349,
      "sha256": "7d6cadec906d358f38650921fc5a6648e0af3abb649148c76f8e408a9a1020b6"
